"# Low-level parts\n\nThe programs the other commands are built from. You seldom type them: aos-agent, aos-daemon-ctl and the templates call them. Use them by hand to try a function, read or edit aos JSON, or look into a mailbox.\n\nEach has `--help` (with subcommands: `aos-post send --help`). Flags go before the first argument. Exit 10 means \"nothing there\" (no letter, no lock, no reply yet), not an error. Errors and retries: `aos/cli/errors.json`.\n"
